# Blurry Text

A text animation component that reveals text with various effects including blur, fade, and slide.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/blurry-text.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/blurry-text.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/blurry-text.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { BlurryText } from '@/registry/blurry-text'
</script>

<template>
  <BlurryText 
    text="Hello World" 
    animation="blurInUp" 
    by="character" 
  />
</template>
```

