### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `text` | `string` | `undefined` | The text to animate. |
| `class` | `string` | `''` | Classes for the container. |
| `segmentClass` | `string` | `''` | Classes for each text segment. |
| `as` | `string` | `'p'` | The HTML tag to use for the container. |
| `delay` | `number` | `0` | Initial delay in seconds. |
| `duration` | `number` | `0.3` | Animation duration for each segment in seconds. |
| `animation` | `string` | `'fadeIn'` | Animation type: `fadeIn`, `blurIn`, `blurInUp`, `blurInDown`, `slideUp`, `slideDown`, `slideLeft`, `slideRight`, `scaleUp`, `scaleDown`. |
| `by` | `string` | `'word'` | Split text by: `text`, `word`, `character`. |
| `startOnView` | `boolean` | `true` | Start animation when element enters the viewport. |
| `once` | `boolean` | `true` | Animate only once. |
